    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A homage to the 90\u2019s horror movies and Series B slashers, REWIND AND RECLAIM is a bloodcurling turn based tactical in which your wits and survivability skills are the only things standing between you and a gruesome death. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the different VHS, outsmart terrible foes, and piece together the story that links them all together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/1e431eafbd2579c9c4d9749af5a41e42.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=66 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/bb42dc0d9fa2300c179d22e0ca176c91.poster.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/bb42dc0d9fa2300c179d22e0ca176c91.webm?t=1739359486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/bb42dc0d9fa2300c179d22e0ca176c91.mp4?t=1739359486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play as a survivor of an 90's horror movie and use your ingenuity and your combativeness to to defy the odds and survive fearsome encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/d16b4a2a75dd63259570932a0586e386.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=66 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/0924470dca9d860ba2c8012ab8a71297.poster.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/0924470dca9d860ba2c8012ab8a71297.webm?t=1739359486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/0924470dca9d860ba2c8012ab8a71297.mp4?t=1739359486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use your environment, from a crowbar to a gas can, and confront creatures much stronger than you in turn-based fights. Explore small scaled but fully-packed tactical maps that\u2019ll get your blood pumping and your brain racking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/fb1c3845043de449f90e40a7c7eb5ab8.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=66 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/2c3ad4bce5cf272a52dbd0d186e9852c.poster.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/2c3ad4bce5cf272a52dbd0d186e9852c.webm?t=1739359486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/2c3ad4bce5cf272a52dbd0d186e9852c.mp4?t=1739359486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every time you play a new run, the enemy type, environment, interactable elements and objectives are randomized, keeping the strategy (and the spook!) fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/c3115db2b219ca376f569274cfcee332.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=66 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/a8cc26eeb251a4b493082e3e7153f6aa.poster.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/a8cc26eeb251a4b493082e3e7153f6aa.webm?t=1739359486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/a8cc26eeb251a4b493082e3e7153f6aa.mp4?t=1739359486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face supernatural slashers, evil puppets, fleshy atrocities, and many more ... All of the classic villains from horror movies are out to get you, and they\u2019ll stop at nothing.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A homage to the 90\u2019s horror movies and Series B slashers, REWIND AND RECLAIM is a bloodcurling turn based tactical in which your wits and survivability skills are the only things standing between you and a gruesome death. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the different VHS, outsmart terrible foes, and piece together the story that links them all together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/1e431eafbd2579c9c4d9749af5a41e42.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=66 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/bb42dc0d9fa2300c179d22e0ca176c91.poster.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/bb42dc0d9fa2300c179d22e0ca176c91.webm?t=1739359486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/bb42dc0d9fa2300c179d22e0ca176c91.mp4?t=1739359486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play as a survivor of an 90's horror movie and use your ingenuity and your combativeness to to defy the odds and survive fearsome encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/d16b4a2a75dd63259570932a0586e386.avif?t=1739359486\" width=600 height=66 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/0924470dca9d860ba2c8012ab8a71297.poster.avif?t=173